DEMO TEST CASES:

TEST 1 – DUPLICATE STUDENT:
Register a synthetic student in College A.
Register the same synthetic APAAR identity in College B.
The system should detect and flag the potential duplicate.

TEST 2 – EXCESS ADMISSION:
Set approved intake to 60.
Register 60 regular admissions.
Attempt another regular admission.
The system should flag the attempt as exceeding approved intake.

TEST 3 – MISSING APAAR:
Submit a student without an APAAR ID.
The system should place the record in the exception queue.

TEST 4 – INVALID CREDENTIAL:
Modify an existing QR credential payload.
The system should detect an invalid digital signature.

TEST 5 – CONSENT:
Request student verification as an employer.
The student must approve the request before protected information is disclosed.

TEST 6 – SEAT UTILIZATION:
Show regular intake and supernumerary seat occupancy separately.

TEST 7 – DATA INCONSISTENCY:
Upload records with missing programme or mismatched institution information.
Display clear row-level errors.

All tests must be executable through the user interface.

